  "body": "Closes #262, I went with the approach outlined [here](https://github.com/whatwg/xhr/issues/262#issuecomment-548720848). Implementation/MDN issues have been filed, and some implementation-specific POCs have also been created ([chromium](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/4189297), [gecko](https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D167576), and [jsdom](https://github.com/jsdom/jsdom/pull/3496)).\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nThank you for contributing to the XMLHttpRequest Standard! Please describe the change you are making and complete the checklist below if your change is not editorial.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\r\n   * [x] [Chromium](https://github.com/whatwg/xhr/pull/366#issuecomment-1400770118)\r\n   * [x] [Gecko](https://github.com/whatwg/xhr/pull/366#issuecomment-1400711102) (via \"👍\" 😃 ) \r\n   * [x] [WebKit](https://github.com/whatwg/xhr/pull/366#issuecomment-1403936986)\r\n   * Additional context in #262 and https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/3195\r\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\r\n   * https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/37895\r\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\r\n   * Chromium: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1410542\r\n   * Gecko: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1812696\r\n   * WebKit: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=251220\r\n- [x] [MDN issue](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) is filed: https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/23917\r\n\r\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\r\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\r\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\r\n\r\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\r\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\r\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\r\n    and remove what's below.\r\n-->\r\n***\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/xhr/366.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 27, 2023, 7:00 AM UTC (e28ed75)\">Preview</a> | <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/xhr/366/494431a...e28ed75.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 27, 2023, 7:00 AM UTC (e28ed75)\">Diff</a>",
